guide forever/class/paladin/lumina-windsinger
title Rescuing Lumina Windsinger
category Class
class Paladin
folder Paladin
faction Horde
race Undead
levels 18-24
zone Tirisfal Glades
keywords Lumina Windsinger, Diplomatic Incident, Trevan Rol, Earthen Ring, Fenris Isle, Fenris Keep, The Windshaper's Wrath, The Debt, Danitha Morr, Forsaken Paladin, class quest
reward text Undercity and Earthen Ring reputation
why No item yet: a Forsaken paladin rescue story; its sequel, the Moonsilver Blade, cannot be finished yet.

# The Forsaken Paladins' Silverpine chain, new in Forever: Diplomatic
# Incident (91858) from Danitha Morr at Bandarion Keep, A Curious Pair
# (91859), A Grim Fate (91860), Into Fenris Keep (91861), Lumina Windsinger
# (91862), The Windshaper's Wrath (96204, an escort) and The Debt (95034).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json (Questie-Forever)
# for givers, enders, objectives and spawns; Forever's quest data for
# the order of the chain (the data has no prerequisites for these quests) and
# for where things are: the pyre "on the shores of Fenris Isle", Lumina caged
# in Fenris Keep, the Fenris Isle Key on the Rot Hide gnolls.
# No quest of this half rewards an item (codex quests.json); the reward line
# is from quests.json: experience and, in its Forever fields,
# Undercity and Earthen Ring reputation. Titled after the goal, Lumina's
# rescue.
# Left out: the rest of the chain, the Moonsilver Blade. A Moon-Kissed Blade
# (95036) asks for an Enchanted Silver Ingot (item 267361) that no source
# places: our data has no spawn for the object it comes from (629065), and
# wow-forever.gg's item page says "nothing in the game data or in play shows a
# way to get it yet". An Underrated Talent (95111), Ott's Masterwork (95125),
# The Moonsilver Blade (95126) and Old Fire-Eye (95140, elite, needs the
# blade) follow from it, and Seeking the Kor Gem (95042, Ulric Frostveil in
# Ashenvale, Blackfathom Deeps) only feeds it. News of 10 October
# 2026 ("New Paladin-Exclusive Cloak Currently Alliance Only") notes the
# Paladin weapon quests of both factions keep changing in the beta.
# The leveling route passes the Sepulcher in forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest
# (levels 16-20). The chain starts with Danitha Morr in Tirisfal Glades, a
# ride north from there, and needs level 18.

step Danitha Morr
  tip Danitha Morr leads the Paladins of Tyr's Watch from inside Bandarion Keep, on the bluffs north-west of the Solliden Farmstead.
  accept 91858                        -- Danitha Morr

step The Sepulcher
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Head south through Silverpine Forest to the Sepulcher. Trevan Rol stands in the town; Deathguard Baldren keeps watch near its entrance.
  turnin 91858                        -- Trevan Rol
  accept 91859
  turnin 91859                        -- Deathguard Baldren
  accept 91860

step The pyre on Fenris Isle
  tip Fenris Isle lies in the lake east of the Sepulcher. The charred remains are on its shore.
  turnin 91860                        -- Charred Remains
  accept 91861                        -- from the Charred Remains

step Fenris Keep
  tip Lumina Windsinger is caged inside Fenris Keep, at the north end of the isle. The Rot Hide gnolls around her carry the key.
  turnin 91861                        -- Lumina Windsinger
  accept 91862
  collect 267412 quest 91862.1        -- Fenris Isle Key, from the Rot Hide gnolls

step Free Lumina
  tip Free her with the key, then stay close while she fights her way out of the keep.
  turnin 91862                        -- Lumina Windsinger
  accept 96204

step Back to the Sepulcher
  tip Once she is clear of Fenris Keep, Lumina waits for you in the Sepulcher. Speak with her again to hear what really happened on the road.
  turnin 96204                        -- Lumina Windsinger, the Sepulcher
  accept 95034
  turnin 95034
